{"type": "tool_call", "toolName": "wren_run_sql", "toolCallId": "call_00_jQAl6OyKUXoEJDq7dCRc0863", "requestId": "94b7af1e-abf7-4fd6-9908-bc29d67032e8", "runId": "b6e9f3c4-555", "seq": 78, "toolInput": "{\"question\":\"2025年1至4月有效订单月度营收（含无订单月份为0，金额分换算为元）：销售额与净营收\",\"group_id\":\"wren-gap-live-20261006-233059\",\"sql\":\"WITH rev AS (\\n  SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', order_month) AS m,\\n         SUM(amount_cents) AS sales_cents,\\n         SUM(net_cents)    AS net_cents\\n  FROM order_net_revenue\\n  WHERE order_month >= DATE '2025-01-01' AND order_month < DATE '2025-05-01'\\n  GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC('month', order_month)\\n)\\nSELECT cm.month AS order_month,\\n       CAST(COALESCE(r.sales_cents, 0) / 100.0 AS DECIMAL(18,2)) AS sales_yuan,\\n       CAST(COALESCE(r.net_cents,   0) / 100.0 AS DECIMAL(18,2)) AS net_revenue_yuan\\nFROM calendar_month cm\\nLEFT JOIN rev r ON FORMAT('%04d-%02d', EXTRACT(YEAR FROM r.m), EXTRACT(MONTH FROM r.m)) = cm.month\\nWHERE cm.month >= '2025-01' AND cm.month <= '2025-04'\\nORDER BY cm.month\"}"}
{"type": "tool_result", "toolName": "wren_run_sql", "toolCallId": "call_00_jQAl6OyKUXoEJDq7dCRc0863", "requestId": "94b7af1e-abf7-4fd6-9908-bc29d67032e8", "runId": "b6e9f3c4-555", "seq": 79, "toolResult": "\"## wren 语义查询结果\\n\\n**知识库：** wren-gap-live-20261006-233059（group_id: `73b26360-df5c-497e-9137-bdfe7f50df67`）\\n\\n**查询问题：** 2025年1至4月有效订单月度营收（含无订单月份为0，金额分换算为元）：销售额与净营收\\n\\n**SQL 语句：**\\n```sql\\nWITH rev AS (\\n  SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', order_month) AS m,\\n         SUM(amount_cents) AS sales_cents,\\n         SUM(net_cents)    AS net_cents\\n  FROM order_net_revenue\\n  WHERE order_month >= DATE '2025-01-01' AND order_month < DATE '2025-05-01'\\n  GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC('month', order_month)\\n)\\nSELECT cm.month AS order_month,\\n       CAST(COALESCE(r.sales_cents, 0) / 100.0 AS DECIMAL(18,2)) AS sales_yuan,\\n       CAST(COALESCE(r.net_cents,   0) / 100.0 AS DECIMAL(18,2)) AS net_revenue_yuan\\nFROM calendar_month cm\\nLEFT JOIN rev r ON FORMAT('%04d-%02d', EXTRACT(YEAR FROM r.m), EXTRACT(MONTH FROM r.m)) = cm.month\\nWHERE cm.month >= '2025-01' AND cm.month <= '2025-04'\\nORDER BY cm.month\\n```\\n\\n**查询结果：**\\n\\n| order_month | sales_yuan | net_revenue_yuan |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 2025-01 | 0.0 | 0.0 |\\n| 2025-02 | 0.0 | 0.0 |\\n| 2025-03 | 0.0 | 0.0 |\\n| 2025-04 | 0.0 | 0.0 |\\n\\n**数据文件：** data/c7266a27a588.csv（4 行 × 3 列；run_python 中 pd.read_csv('data/c7266a27a588.csv') 读取）\\n\""}
